WEBVTT

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.020
<i>Finally.</i>

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.760
<i>The last goddess.</i>

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>Ayumi's parameters are such a mess, 
they're impossible to analyze.</i>

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.950
<i>I need to skip the logic and 
jump straight to the confession.</i>

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.370
Apologize to Chihiro!

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.840
I never want to see your face again!

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.130
<i>Run all you want.</i>

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.380
<i>I'll still catch you!</i>

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.110
No way... Really?

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.540
Really!

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:09.440
<b>Labyrinth</b>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.020
Sorry I'm late!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.600
Our charismatic waitress has arrived!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.900
Over here!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.760
Master, everyone's here.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:16.650
Okay.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.150
Then it's time to open shop.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:23.500
Why did you suddenly decide to help,

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.560
as uncooperative as you are?

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.150
My family runs a café...

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:30.420
I refuse to let you serve bad coffee.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.640
Hold on! This coffee's really good!

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.560
It's like I've been drinking muddy water!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.930
Gold Blend! Excella!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.640
With the dweeb as the master 
and Ayumi as a waitress,

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.660
we have an amazing lineup!

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.180
Welcome!

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.440
This is the 2-B Café!

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.440
I said I never wanted to see your face again.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:58.690
The more I see your face, 
the more I hate you.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.950
At least that means you won't forget I exist.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.400
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.050
<i>What's that supposed to mean?</i>

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.040
<i>It's like he's trying to sweet talk me...</i>

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.710
Two cafés au lait.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.710
W-We need cafés au lait.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:14.670
<i>Don't give her time to think!</i>

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.120
<i>Confess my love first!</i>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.560
Ayumi...

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.550
Hey, what are you trying to do?

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.110
You working hard, Ayumi?

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:22.950
Check this out...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.680
It's like a real café.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:28.930
Ch-Chihiro!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.880
Ayumi...

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:33.890
You look good.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.440
Good luck.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.520
Chihiro!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.200
The cafés au lait are done.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.080
Katsuragi...

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.160
Don't talk to me anymore.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.580
<i>Damn...</i>

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.560
<i>Gauging the effect Chihiro's 
having on Ayumi is too hard.</i>

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.250
Welcome!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.680
Hey, where are the cups?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.850
It's pretty early to be running out of cups.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.680
They should have planned better...

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.940
I need you to say something, or I can't advance!

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.830
Advance what?

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:23.580
I told you not to talk to me, jerk!

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.600
Am I doing this right?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.530
I can't tell.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.210
J-Just stop it, stupid.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:35.550
Ayu—

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.840
Yo.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.270
Chihiro...

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:42.830
Your shift's over, right?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.860
Give me your apron and headband.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.430
Right...

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:53.350
What were you talking to Katsuragi about?

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.500
I didn't think you were so close.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.770
I-It isn't what you think...

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:00.860
I was...

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.990
rejected by Katsuragi.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.370
And this time, I was pretty serious.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.910
But I guess it just wasn't right!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:18.680
So would you stop talking 
to Katsuragi about me?

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.530
You're a good friend,

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.450
so I'm sure you were telling 
him stuff about me.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.820
That's all I wanted to say.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:25.670
Chihiro!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.130
We have another customer.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:28.960
Could you take her order?

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.140
Sure thing...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.110
Ayumi,

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.990
thank you.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.670
Yes, get as many soldiers as you can.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.800
Welcome! What would you like?

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.120
Coffee with heaps of sugar.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.300
Gotcha.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:53.580
One coffee!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.330
Nothing important.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.270
I just feel like a little goddess-hunting.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:04.410
<i>It's no good...</i>

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:06.050
<i>Regardless of the route I take,</i>

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.930
<i>I'll run into Chihiro eventually.</i>

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.570
<i>How do I remove her from the route?</i>

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:20.940
Humans are such an enigma to me...

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.350
Mer...

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.940
What makes you so hesitant?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.250
You already know the answer.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.030
All that's left is for you to 
decide what you should do.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.130
I just tagged her.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.880
This is your target.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:47.380
Once your preparations are complete,

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.190
begin the hunt.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:51.460
Hey, young lady!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.890
How about some takoyaki?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.390
I'll take one.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:59.260
<i>Where did Ayumi go?</i>

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.660
<i>There she is!</i>

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:11.990
Chihiro!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:13.950
Join forces with me.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:17.870
Huh?!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:22.650
In any route I choose for conquering 
Ayumi, you will be an obstacle,

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.480
and one that won't be easily removed.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.630
Instead, I'll have you help me.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.200
It's the only way to end this fast.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.380
So let's work together—

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:38.140
What are you babbling about, cockroach?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.390
How can you act like nothing happened?!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.190
Have you forgotten what you said to me?

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.860
Of course I remember...

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.870
But right now, there's no time for that.

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.150
Let's set aside our differences

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.900
and form an alliance.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.910
You scumbag!

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.640
<i>If the goddesses escaped with the loose souls,</i>

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.470
<i>and they're both in this world...</i>

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:07.290
<i>The goddesses may be hiding within loose souls.</i>

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.420
<i>I suppose it's possible...</i>

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.440
Our preparations are complete, Lady Lune.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.970
We will begin now.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.320
Go ahead.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.890
<i>Where did Ayumi go?</i>

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.110
Oh, hey!

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.450
Chihiro...

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:39.060
I've been looking for you.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.670
When we introduce the members tomorrow...

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.190
I can't.

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.310
I just can't...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.130
be in a band with you anymore.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:50.930
Ayumi?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:55.110
<i>Damn! She beat me to her...</i>

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.010
What do you mean?

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.940
I can't forgive myself...

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:08.070
I was never rooting for you...

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.840
<i>Why is she saying this?</i>

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.030
<i>It'll make it harder to advance!</i>

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.300
I'm terrible...

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.340
While you were hurting,

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:20.880
all I could think of was Katsura—

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:22.040
Finally found you.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.750
You wanted to talk to me, Chihiro?

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.780
Huh? What are you...

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:30.210
Hey, wait!

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.680
Can you please leave without saying anything?

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.470
If you hear what Ayumi's about to say, 
the conquest will take longer!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.720
What's your problem?!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.500
Sorry, Ayumi...

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.740
What were you saying?

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.470
Ah...

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.230
Wh-Where was I?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.470
<i>I can't let this conversation continue.</i>

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.230
Listen to me!

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:50.980
I need to talk to you both.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:54.230
<i>The alarm?</i>

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.400
<i>Who is it? Who set it off?</i>

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:09.580
What is this?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.710
Stop!

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:10.710
<i>Vintage...</i>

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.590
<i>Damn, they figured it out?</i>

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:20.090
Lady Lune, I have secured two, plus one.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.470
Gira?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.100
Ah, I just captured one myself.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.100
It took a bit of effort, though...

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.250
It sounds like everything's gone 
smoothly with the other targets.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.610
We'll gather the goddesses and kill them.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.110
Talk...

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.870
What are you up to?

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:47.630
Ayumi! Chihiro!

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:48.570
Say something!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.760
Damn, I was so close...

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.270
Take them away.

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:14.900
Who's there?

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:18.280
Return from whence you came,

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.430
servants of evil!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:42.550
<i>Are you awake?</i>

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.410
<i>You?</i>

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:54.480
<i>Was I taken off the Loose Souls Team?</i>

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.560
<i>You were to be dismissed and punished.</i>

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.740
<i>Otherwise, Vintage would have killed you.</i>

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.740
<i>Where are we?</i>

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:04.850
<i>The surface of Ancient Hell.</i>

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.730
<i>Once we reach the boundary, you can get out.</i>

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:10.980
<i>You're smuggling me out?</i>

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.250
<i>As if I'm a criminal.</i>

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>Well, you were dismissed from the 
Loose Souls Team for treason,</i>

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.590
<i>so you actually are a criminal.</i>

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:22.260
<i>I didn't do anything wrong!</i>

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:26.010
<i>That's right, I...</i>

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.250
<i>I just did what I thought to be right.</i>

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:33.600
<i>But everything's gone wrong...</i>

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.440
<i>Haqua...</i>

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:41.020
<i>Long ago, there was a battle 
between good and evil</i>

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.540
<i>that rendered Hell inhabitable.</i>

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:47.450
<i>When New Hell was created afterward,</i>

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:52.250
<i>nothing had really changed 
beneath the surface...</i>

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.800
<i>All kinds of scheming behind the scenes,</i>

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.710
<i>while the righteous are framed and driven out.</i>

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.470
<i>We must put an end to this.</i>

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.360
<i>Here, there isn't any miasma.</i>

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.670
<i>Haqua, in the past, the Scythe of Testament</i>

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:24.190
<i>was only granted to demons from noble families.</i>

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.280
<i>However, you were able to 
outperform your peers,</i>

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.150
<i>earning the scythe via individual distinction.</i>

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:35.960
<i>In our school's long history, it was the 
first time such a thing has happened.</i>

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.480
<i>Haqua du Lot Herminium,</i>

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.480
<i>you are no longer a member 
of the Loose Souls Team.</i>

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.920
<i>You exist outside the law.</i>

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.970
<i>However, only you can save New Hell.</i>

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.470
<i>I have a special mission for you.</i>

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.910
<i>Go to Earth, rescue and protect the goddesses,</i>

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.690
<i>and stop Vintage's plot!</i>

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.440
<i>New Hell's future</i>

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.190
<i>is in your hands.</i>

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:12.240
Haqua!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.870
Are you with the Loose Souls Team?

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.730
No, I am the one who

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.000
will defend the honor of the modern demons!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.150
Chihiro! Ayumi!

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.010
Run!

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:40.230
Are you using Ancient Hell magic?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.530
How can you fly without a raiment?!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.940
Just simple movement spells anyone can use.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.910
It simply takes twenty of them at once!

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:02.230
Which is impossible for demons like you 
that rely on the power of others!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.590
It's okay.

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.850
I didn't kill them.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:26.270
Sorry for taking so long to get back.

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:30.480
It's okay, you saved us.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.830
K-Katsuragi?

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.450
Is it safe over there?

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:36.950
Think fast.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.750
Great! You've put together an excellent show!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:40.750
Huh?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:45.420
Your Special Effects Film Society will 
be the talk of the Mai High Festival!

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.310
I'm in the middle of Ayumi's conquest.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.170
Play along.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.090
We have to cover up what happened.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.430
You never change...

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.600
What did you think of our 
Film Society's superhero show?

00:15:58.260 --> 00:15:59.300
Film Society?

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.430
That was an act?

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.640
Sorry to drag you into it.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:07.190
Katsuragi said there was this 
girl he wanted to surprise.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.430
Wait! This was your idea?

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.630
Explain what this is!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.820
Uh, well...

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.300
It's all yours now.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.740
You're always doing stupid stuff!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.830
You've gotten good at this.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.830
No kidding!

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:21.330
So, are they Film Society members?

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:25.470
They're people who want to conquer the world.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.710
The story doesn't have much substance...

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.060
You might want to rethink it some.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:31.250
Katsuragi, Vintage has attacked the goddesses.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:31.590
Well, the special effects were great.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:34.110
How much do they know?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:37.050
They hacked into my raiment's tag and learned

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.080
that we were investigating your former conquests.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.560
Someone in Vintage was smart enough to realize

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.310
that goddesses might be hiding 
together with loose souls.

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:52.510
No luck.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:55.110
I can't reach Yui, Tsukiyo, or Shiori.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:58.280
Were all the goddesses attacked?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.710
It could be even worse.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.540
If they don't know which girls 
are hosting the goddesses,

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.900
they'll target every possible candidate.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:11.590
Which means they may have attacked 
every girl you've conquered.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.630
We've brought them all.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.880
So which are goddesses?

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:20.970
Well, checking each one 
would be too much effort.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.640
Might as well kill them all.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.800
Our first priority is to get somewhere safe.

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.740
Vintage is everywhere!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:32.190
What are they talking about?

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.480
I'm going home.

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:36.800
Huh? Didn't you have something to tell me?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:38.680
I'll call you later.

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:39.410
Bye.

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:41.160
Ayumi?

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.270
I'll bring her back!

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.160
Wait.

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:48.030
For my conquest to succeed, 
it's better to let Ayumi leave.

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:48.670
Eh?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.670
At this point, your conquest doesn't matter!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.140
Can you guard Ayumi without her seeing you?

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:56.540
Then who'll protect you?!

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.680
I'll keep an eye

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.090
on that Ayumi girl.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:01.930
Nora!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:05.010
I'm not siding with you guys.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:09.060
But I don't like the idea of Vintage 
running loose in my district.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.550
You can refuse my offer,

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.820
but are you in any position to be choosy?

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:17.890
Fine. This leaves us more options.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.410
We'll let Nora look after Ayumi.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:20.570
That leaves...

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.060
Chihiro...

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.780
Let me go! Let me go!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:25.820
You're coming home with me.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.740
What's wrong with you?

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:28.940
Elsie is waiting for you!

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:29.830
Eh?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.840
Why am I back

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:38.560
in Katsuragi's house?!

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.600
He told me to wait here, but...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.850
Is Ellie in her room?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.840
So Kanon was taken...

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.110
They've taken every goddess except Ayumi?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:57.110
They didn't take all of us.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.400
Diana, you're okay?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.870
I was never attacked.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:07.290
I saw some suspicious figures leaving 
your room with a large sack.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.500
It seemed quite odd.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.070
But I thought reaching out to my 
sisters would be dangerous,

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.660
so I laid low.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.840
That confirms our suspicions.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.880
Vintage has determined that the goddesses

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.140
are inside Katsuragi's conquests, 
and has taken them all.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.380
Officially, Nora captured Tenri's 
loose soul, so they excluded her.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.910
Wait, what about Elsie?

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:40.650
Elsie, you okay?

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:43.220
Soufflé?

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:47.410
Okay, let's have soufflé for 
dinner, Exalted Brother...

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.460
She's fine.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.830
Katsuragi, before I came back, 
I did some research.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.920
Vintage seeks to revive Ancient Hell.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.130
The problem is with the chosen location.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:05.420
They will use the rock by the 
Maijima beach as a gate

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.330
to bring the Weiss to this world!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:12.940
If we don't stop them, 
Earth will be in big trouble.

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:16.820
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:21.570
A gap in space-time separates Earth and Hell.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.570
Beyond that rock

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:28.120
lies the final battlefield of Armage-machina...

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:32.110
East Greda Fortress.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:36.590
That is where the goddesses placed the seal.

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:40.000
Vintage intends to create an opening

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:43.440
and summon the Weiss that remain in Hell.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.680
They will abandon that barren world,

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.870
and bring Ancient Hell to Earth!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.460
When will they put their plan into action?

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.730
I'm not entirely certain,

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.360
but I'd say tomorrow.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.030
Please give me a chance.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.790
I will stop Vintage, on my honor as a goddess.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:07.640
No!

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:09.420
It isn't only Vintage you must consider.

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:12.680
That place is filled with level-4 loose souls!

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:13.870
It's too dangerous!

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:18.750
<i>Those things?</i>

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.610
I'll go.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.280
Haqua?

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.020
This is a war for Hell!

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:24.410
So...

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:25.000
No!

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:29.510
If war breaks out, none of us 
will be able to stop it.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:32.670
Thus, we can't let this become a war!

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:34.220
What do we—

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:35.550
We can still stop them!

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:37.320
There must be a route.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:40.150
I will conquer Ayumi.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.530
You intend to release Mercurius?

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:45.560
They were trying to kidnap us.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:48.590
If they'd suspected we'd interfere, 
they'd have attacked us as they did Kanon.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.560
There's a reason they didn't try to kill us.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:53.040
We still have a chance.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:54.540
No change in plan.

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:57.310
We use the route that assembles the goddesses.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:00.110
Ow!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.130
Chihiro?

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:03.670
What are you people going to do with Ayumi?

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.090
<b>Call from Ayumi</b>

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:07.610
Hello?

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:09.070
Huh? Katsuragi?

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:11.010
Why are you answering Chihiro's phone?

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.180
I'm on my way over

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.950
to confess my love!

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:16.060
Huh?

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:18.410
Diana, wait in the house.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:19.800
Haqua, you come with me.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:20.770
And, Chihiro...

00:22:21.490 --> 00:22:23.070
Hold on!

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:25.340
Let me go! Let me go!

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:26.570
Just come with me!

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.750
What are you trying to do?

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:30.550
<i>There's no time to hesitate.</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:33.030
<i>I must go straight for the ending!</i>

00:24:05.770 --> 00:24:07.240
The goddesses have been captured.

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:09.090
Vintage is swarming around us.

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:10.750
But there's no need for panic or fear.

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.050
It's conquest time!

00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:17.980
Ayumi, prepare to taste Keima 
Katsuragi's greatest conquest.

00:24:17.980 --> 00:24:19.500
You sound like a bad guy.
